Managed in the dashboard:

  domains           Domain setup and DNS verification            https://app.mailkube.com/domain/setup
  api-keys          API keys                                     https://app.mailkube.com/domain/credentials#api
  smtp-credentials  SMTP credentials                             https://app.mailkube.com/domain/credentials#smtp
  webhooks          Webhook endpoints and their signing secrets  https://app.mailkube.com/domain/webhooks
  templates         Saved templates                              https://app.mailkube.com/domain/templates
  suppressions      Suppressed recipients                        https://app.mailkube.com/domain/suppressions
  audience          Contacts, segments and topics                https://app.mailkube.com/domain/audience
  logs              Delivery history                             https://app.mailkube.com/domain/logs

The CLI covers sending, scheduled sends and the local webhook loop.
